  "recovery.ask.scan.title": "First, scan your trusted member’s screen",
  "@recovery.ask.scan.title": {"description": "S11.2 step 1 heading. ADR 2026-09-13c ruling 1 🔒 — before any key is put back together this phone must see the user's own key off a member's already-verified phone, so the server cannot hand it a key of its own."},
  "recovery.ask.scan.body": "Ask one of them to open this app and show you the square code on their screen. Scanning it is how this phone makes sure the books it opens are really yours.",
